title: Dashboard › Arrive › What the page shows
route: /dashboard
intro: Four ways to land on the Dashboard, how the address and the viewer's sites are read, and the page from the top down: a small title, the Lifecycle, Do next and one table of authorizations. Each part continues in its own diagram.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Dashboard' in the sidebar\nThe badge counts Info requested at the sites in view"
start s2 "Open the app at /\nThe address / goes to /dashboard"
start s3 "Follow a link with a request or a filter\nA notification, Ask FLO, a Do next button, or a button on another page"
start s4 "Demo menu › Click 'Reset demo data'"
toast t1 "'Demo data reset'\n'Everything is back to the starting point.'"

process p1 "Page opens and reads the address, the viewer and the sites in view\nEvery count, row and button below follows those sites"
decision d0 "Does the address hold ?request=ID for a case at a site the viewer cannot see?"
screen oos "Out-of-site card\n'This case is not available at Site A'\nIt names no patient; link 'Back to the Dashboard'"
endx x1 "The Dashboard is not drawn behind the card\nThe link drops ?request and the page opens"
decision d1 "Does the address hold payer, program, type or stage?"
process p2 "The address wins\nThe four menus go back to All, then the address values apply\nUnknown values are ignored"
process p3 "The remembered filters are written back to the address\nFirst visit: no filters"
store w1 "Filters\nPayer, Program, Request type, Status (the stage)"

screen sc "Dashboard\nOne cockpit: what to do now, and where every authorization stands"
decision d2 "Does the address hold ?request=ID?"
decision d3 "Is there a request with that ID?"
overlay o1 "Request drawer opens over the page"
process p4 "Nothing opens\nThe ?request part is removed after 0.2 seconds"
end e1 "Page shown with no drawer"

group gPage "On the page, from the top down"
  screen h1 "Small title and one quiet line\n'18 requests are waiting on payers. 3 are waiting on you.'\n'What to do now, and where every authorization stands.'"
  click ca "Click 'Check all now'\nTop right; disabled while Navigator is paused in Settings"
  screen lc "Lifecycle card\nFive state chips with counts: Awaiting sign-off, Submitted, Decision pending, Info requested, Denied / appeal\nTwo links with an arrow: Active, Renewal due"
  screen dn "Do next card\n'Suggested by FLO from today's demo data'\nUp to five plain sentences, each with one button"
  screen tb "Table card\n'40 authorizations' and one quiet sentence\n'Needs me today', Payer, Program, Status and Request type\nNine columns, 'Show 8 more'"
endgroup

goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Open and read a request"
goto g2 "Continues in: Dashboard › Title › What the title and quiet line say"
goto g3 "Continues in: Dashboard › Header › Check all now and the demo clock"
goto g4 "Continues in: Dashboard › Lifecycle › Click a state to filter the table"
goto g5 "Continues in: Dashboard › Do next › What to do now and where each button leads"
goto g6 "Continues in: Dashboard › Table controls › Needs me today, Payer, Program, Status and Request type"
goto g7 "Continues in: Dashboard › Requests table › Order, rows and paging"
goto g8 "Continues in: Dashboard › Sites › What each site sees and out-of-site links"
goto g9 "Continues in: Dashboard › Table controls › Clear filters and empty states"

s1 --> p1
s2 --> p1
s3 --> p1
s4 --> t1 --> p1
p1 --> d0
d0 -->|Yes| oos --> x1
d0 -->|No| d1
d1 -->|Yes| p2 --> w1
d1 -->|No| p3 --> w1
w1 --> sc
sc --> d2
d2 -->|No| e1
d2 -->|Yes| d3
d3 -->|Yes| o1 --> g1
d3 -->|No| p4 --> e1

sc --> h1 --> lc --> dn --> tb
h1 --> g2
h1 --> ca --> g3
lc --> g4
dn --> g5
tb --> g6
tb --> g7
tb --> g9
p1 -.-> g8
